WEBVTT

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.370
Life with an Ordinary Guy who Reincarnated into a

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.370
Total Fantasy Knockout

00:01:30.630 --> 00:01:31.790
What is this?

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:33.980
A map of the world. What about it?

00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:35.250
Nothing.

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:37.360
It's shaped like a woman.

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:39.490
Now, let's go, hero.

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:43.490
An audience with the king, huh?

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:46.120
I'm worried I'm gonna screw this up.

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:49.920
Please don't worry about 
any of that and just speak.

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:53.200
You are a treasure 
created by our goddess.

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:57.510
In that sense, you are the only 
one who is equal to royalty.

00:01:57.920 --> 00:01:59.140
What do you mean?

00:01:59.770 --> 00:02:03.600
The goddess of love and beauty 
created our kingdom's royal family.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:06.200
The first king received her blessing,

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:09.770
and her crest only appears upon the bodies 
of those who inherit that same blessing.

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:13.340
It proves that they are of the 
goddess's family, so to speak.

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:16.840
I see. So that's why it 
would be a crime of perjury.

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:20.530
But haven't you thought that 
Tachibana's crest might be fake?

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:22.990
Your preparations seem much too thorough.

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:25.710
You arrived too quickly after 
we caused that uproar.

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:28.760
And there's far too little delay in 
getting an audience with the king.

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:29.830
Hey, Shen!

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.920
How long have you had your eye on us?

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:33.920
Oh, dear. Have I been found out?

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:36.250
What is with you?

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:39.430
Oh, supervisor. Haven't you 
introduced yourself yet?

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:40.880
Supervisor?

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:45.700
Apologies for not saying sooner. I am 
entrusted with the kingdom's intelligence.

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:47.310
My name is Mouria.

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:51.060
I will attend to your needs during 
your stay in our kingdom—

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:55.400
Oh, but to think that you are 
the heroes, Jinguuji-san.

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:56.940
No wonder you're so strong.

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:00.650
I hope that you will continue 
to favor me with your patronage.

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:02.180
I will prove useful!

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:04.690
Particularly at night, 
in the bedroom, even...

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:09.090
Honored heroes...

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:12.390
The king awaits.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:21.010
Episode 9.

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:21.010
A Guy Who Reincarnated as a Fantasy     .
Knockout and a Beautiful Girl                     .

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:23.510
Thank you for coming.

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:28.060
We welcome you, heroes 
summoned by our goddess!

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:32.950
I can't anymore. I wanna go home.

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:34.400
Don't freak out.

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:37.070
All I see is a normal old guy
 you'd see at a sauna.

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:42.020
<i>The main characters of those stories where 
they end up in another world are amazing!</i>

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:44.820
<i>They make it through audiences 
with royalty like it's normal.</i>

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:48.580
We are pleased to have the opportunity 
to meet you, Your Majesty.

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:52.120
Tachibana.

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:56.380
<i>I see.</i>

00:03:56.380 --> 00:04:00.710
<i>He intends for me to charm the king to 
give us an edge in this discussion, huh?</i>

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:02.820
<i>Take this!</i>

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:06.280
<i>This is my smile, the 
cutest in all of history!</i>

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:08.100
Hello!

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:14.350
<i>Wait. Was giving a double 
peace sign going too far?</i>

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:19.940
Our goddess's creations 
are sublime and lovely.

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:23.110
<i>Oof! And it didn't really even work!</i>

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:25.280
<i>Oh, man. I wanna die.</i>

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:29.120
"The goddess's creations"?
Is that from the prophecy, too?

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:34.120
So the heroes are unaware of 
the contents of the prophecy?

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:35.630
That's right.

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:38.180
In that case, bring out a lyre.

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:48.080
Dear King, are you doing well?

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:50.070
Yay!

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.810
In order to defeat the Demon Lord,

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:58.360
the most stirring and emo 
hero in all the universe

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:00.650
has been summoned.

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:02.660
With cuteness on a completely 
different level

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:05.250
everyone will fall in love with her.

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:07.570
It's seriously hilarious. Like, what?

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:11.960
I've left a star on my fav,
 so go and search, okay?

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:17.110
Counting on ya to give 
your full support, 'kay?

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:22.480
So quit fighting wars for now, pleeze.

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:23.950
Pleeze!

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:27.130
I luv, luv you all. Kiss, kiss, bye!

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:29.340
Kiss, kiss, bye!

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:33.130
What a beautiful poem!

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:36.310
Yes. And our king's beautiful 
voice is splendid as well!

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:38.280
That was amazing.

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:40.920
Yes, it was. Truly amazing.

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:41.820
It really was.

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:47.410
Our goddess's words are complex and 
it always takes time to decipher them.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:52.520
By our goddess's hand, a beautiful young woman
 was created and summoned here as a hero.

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:56.240
Find the one bearing the holy crest 
so that we may be led to safety.

00:05:56.240 --> 00:05:57.800
That is what the words must mean.

00:05:57.800 --> 00:06:00.870
It's amazing that you turned those 
words into something so nice.

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:05.230
Heroes who have been summoned here 
by the goddess of love and beauty!

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:07.370
For the sake of demonstrating 
our goddess' might,

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:10.860
you must do whatever it takes to defeat 
the Demon Lord before anyone else!

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:14.350
To that purpose, we will not shirk 
from lending you our support!

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:18.100
Really. Support? What kind specifically?

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:19.790
Well, let's see...

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:23.480
We can give them our national 
budget for the year, right?

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:25.110
Will the national budget be enough?

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.830
Please use the military's budget as well.

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:28.520
Let's give them the taxes.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:30.980
This shows my charm definitely worked.

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:34.830
Looks like my cuteness proved useful, huh?

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:38.580
I think it's about time you 
acknowledged it. Right?

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:41.640
Well, it's true it's a 
handy face to have around.

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:43.210
Though it's not to my taste.

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:45.180
You're still against it?

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:48.000
It's been useful, so you 
could give me some praise!

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:51.420
Since I became a woman, you've gotten 
colder toward me, don't you think?

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:53.740
Like when we were fighting with Shen!

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:55.620
Excuse me for interrupting your conversation—

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:58.730
Are you really saying that you 
like Shen's body more than mine?!

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:02.130
It's a misunderstanding. 
Did you need something?

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:03.600
Oh, that's right.

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:07.000
We've decided
 to hold a banquet tonight.

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:07.660
Huh?

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:08.860
A banquet?

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:15.800
So they wear normal clothes 
at times like this.

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:17.160
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:25.630
So what do you think?

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:29.000
The maids all did their very best,
 and it was worth it, right?

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:32.010
Oh, you changed, too! 
It looks good on you.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:45.020
<b>Jinguuji Family Grave</b>

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:48.800
Shen! Smelling salts!

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:49.280
Yes, sir!

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:53.530
<b>Inhale      Exhale</b>

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:53.530
Hey. What's wrong?

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.230
You're banned from entering.

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:56.530
Why?!

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:05.240
This is no fun. I wanna go inside.

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:06.790
I don't think there's anything to be done...

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:10.760
Will this be enough?

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.800
Oh! Thank you!

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:16.450
So what about alcohol?

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:17.800
You can't have any, of course.

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:18.970
<i>Dash</i>

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:21.310
What will you do if things 
turn out like that other time?

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:24.660
Don't be so strict. Just a sip!

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:27.270
No. The alcohol is pretty strong.

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:30.820
So you had some? No fair.

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:36.820
Oh, it must be tough for you, Tachibana-san.

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:40.870
This kingdom's alcohol is truly delicious!

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.570
You didn't need to say that.

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:43.690
Is it good?

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:49.340
I wanna drink good alcohol!
I wanna drink it! I wanna drink it!

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:50.720
Tachibana!

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:51.880
That's enough.

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:53.470
Wh-What's with you?

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:56.260
Lately, you've been much too careless.

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:58.100
Ow, ow, ow!

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:00.890
Throw away the idea that 
you'll be fine if it's me.

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:05.140
What do you think will happen if I stop 
being able to fight off your charm here?

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:09.150
Jinguuji-sama, this is a celebration. 
There's no need to go that far.

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:10.960
No, this is a good opportunity.

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:14.400
Can you imagine the state I was in earlier?

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:16.410
It's hell on earth!

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:18.560
Your conduct lately has been intolerable.

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:19.910
Are you listening? Hey!

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:21.430
Tachibana!

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:26.020
Do you feel disheartened?

00:09:26.020 --> 00:09:27.530
Do I look disheartened?

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:31.170
Getting angry with that expression... 
Anyone would react like that!

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:34.060
<i>Blast it. Giving me a serious scolding...</i>

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:36.340
<i>even though deep down he thinks I'm cute!</i>

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:38.680
<i>No...</i>

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:41.920
<i>Maybe I shouldn't because 
I know how he feels.</i>

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:45.430
<i>It's been a while since I've 
seen him make that expression.</i>

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:50.990
<i>That's right. Jinguuji's 
warning me in his own way.</i>

00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:52.770
<i>But I...</i>

00:09:55.170 --> 00:09:57.950
<i>Keep fighting! I must maintain 
my personal preferences!</i>

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:01.450
<i>I don't know if it's a curse 
or what, but Jinguuji's a man!</i>

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:04.240
<i>I am a 32-year-old male!</i>

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:06.820
<i>My ideal is a young, beautiful, blonde woman!</i>

00:10:06.820 --> 00:10:11.460
<i>If possible, a little childlike, but 
still sharp, and a little melancholy...</i>

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:17.470
<i>Yes, just...</i>

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:19.690
<i>like this...</i>

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:21.550
Shen.

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:25.970
Life with an Ordinary Guy who Reincarnated into a Total Fantasy Knockout

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:25.970
<b>Aaaah</b>

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:22.340
Jinguuji-san.

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:23.000
Shen.

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:23.830
Jinguuji-san.

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:24.440
Shen.

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:25.970
Jinguuji-san.

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:28.480
Is someone there?

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:32.080
<i>Why did I go and hide?</i>

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:35.110
Goodbye, world.

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:37.390
What are you doing?!

00:10:37.390 --> 00:10:39.680
What do you mean?
It's plain to see I'm jumping.

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:41.900
Like it's really normal?!

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:44.370
What? Are you trying to convince me not to?

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:46.160
Normally, that's what you do, right?

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:49.120
No, no, no! A suicide right 
in front of me is no joke!

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:52.410
Oh, be quiet! It's pointless! 
Everything in this world is pointless!

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:55.380
Huh? Well... Um, there's... You know...

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:57.900
<i>Why? Why have things turned out this way?</i>

00:10:57.900 --> 00:10:59.880
<i>What am I supposed to do 
in a situation like this?</i>

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:03.360
<i>They say things like "keep fighting" and  
"don't give in" have the opposite effect...</i>

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:05.390
<i>So should I try to distract her or something?</i>

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:08.390
C-Could you give me some advice?

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:09.970
Advice?

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:16.090
You weren't born in this country, were you?

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:17.030
You can tell?

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:20.900
Well, I've never met someone 
as beautiful as you.

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:24.130
I think you're much more beautiful than I am.

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:27.290
<i>What am I hitting on her for?!</i>

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:30.790
<b>Stare</b>

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:30.790
<i>I'm safe. I'm a girl right now. So it's fine!</i>

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:34.880
I'm tired of hearing those words of praise.

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:35.710
<i>Wow.</i>

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:40.620
So the person I'm traveling with...

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:43.220
We've been together since we were little.

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:45.220
He's a guy who can do everything.

00:11:46.210 --> 00:11:49.200
And I keep being a burden to him.

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:53.380
So I looked to see if there 
was something I could do,

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:55.360
but I couldn't find anything.

00:11:55.360 --> 00:12:00.400
And I thought that at a banquet,
I might be able to use my looks to help,

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:03.740
but on top of failing at that,
 I got a real scolding.

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:05.820
<b>Sigh</b>

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:07.740
I see.

00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:10.700
I understand your worries.

00:12:11.190 --> 00:12:14.970
You wanted that person to say you're cute, 
but you failed and now you're depressed.

00:12:14.970 --> 00:12:15.710
That's not it.

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:19.140
The gentleman you're thinking of 
just won't turn and look at you.

00:12:19.140 --> 00:12:20.770
Well, it is a common problem.

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:21.960
That's not it.

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:23.530
And I'm sorry.

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:27.720
I've never not been praised, so I don't 
think I'll have a good answer for you.

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:32.300
<i>Huh, so she's the type who 
doesn't listen either, right?</i>

00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:33.330
You know...

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:38.760
I wanted regular advice about how 
not to cause my partner more work...

00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:39.480
Huh?

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:42.490
It's been useful, so you 
could give me some praise!

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:45.800
<i>Did I... want him to praise me?</i>

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:47.700
<i>Oh man, I can't deny it.</i>

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:51.590
<i>I totally want to bask in 
that feeling of superiority.</i>

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:52.350
<i>But...</i>

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:56.610
<i>If all I want is to bask in my superiority, 
I've charmed other men.</i>

00:12:56.610 --> 00:13:01.210
<i>No, having other guys praise me 
 doesn't make me happy.</i>

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:01.880
<i>Why is that?</i>

00:13:02.520 --> 00:13:05.470
You're amazing! You did so well!

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:09.340
<i>Even after being with Jinguuji for so long,</i>

00:13:09.340 --> 00:13:12.240
<i>have I ever once been praised by him?</i>

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:14.140
<i>No, I haven't. I seriously haven't!</i>

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:17.400
<i>Have I wanted him to praise me?!</i>

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:21.400
<i>Is my mentality so like an 
elementary schooler's? Is it?</i>

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:26.150
Hee hee hee

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:25.120
You must love that person very much.

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:26.150
I absolutely do not.

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:28.480
Truly hopeless.

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:30.410
H-H-Hopeless?!

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:33.660
Hopeless, but it did prove a distraction.

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:39.170
Thank you. I like you quite a bit.

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:45.670
<i>My feeling this way about Jinguuji 
is definitely the curse's fault.</i>

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:47.470
<i>I know that.</i>

00:13:48.170 --> 00:13:53.430
<i>I mean, just spending time with that 
beautiful girl has made me feel this good!</i>

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:57.850
<i>These are my real feelings, 
and those other feelings are fake.</i>

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:00.720
Oh wow, she smelled so nice!

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.110
<i>As usual, he's really close.</i>

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:08.360
I want to see your smile.

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:10.000
What's this all of a sudden? What's wrong?

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:13.290
So please, make up as quickly as possible.

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:14.480
Hey, Tachibana?

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:16.790
<i>Thank you. I like you quite a bit.</i>

00:14:17.850 --> 00:14:19.200
Who are you?

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:20.080
Huh?

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:22.170
Wha?! The real one?!

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:24.800
So you're the hero!

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:26.160
Princess!

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:27.780
P-Princess?

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:33.250
I am the first princess of this 
kingdom. I am called Ygraine.

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:36.680
Last night I did not know and 
so I was terribly impolite.

00:14:37.010 --> 00:14:40.810
<i>I see. So she's the reason 
Tachibana's acting strangely.</i>

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:44.940
Honored hero, I have come 
today with a request.

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:49.200
Would you please take me on your journey 
to defeat the Demon Lord?

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:50.040
Huh?

00:14:51.010 --> 00:14:53.160
It feels like destiny!

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:55.870
Please allow me to accompany you!

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:57.790
Can't I?

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:00.970
Of course you can't.

00:15:02.280 --> 00:15:05.270
Our journey is difficult, 
dirty, and dangerous.

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:06.800
You could call it the three Ds.

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:10.480
It's not the kind of dreamlike 
fantasy a child might imagine.

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:14.180
Oh, there it is. Treating me 
like a child. What a pain.

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:19.270
Could you stay out of this 
conversation, please?

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:22.010
I am speaking with our honored hero.

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:22.690
Really?

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:26.940
You should, well... 
Do something amusing.

00:15:27.300 --> 00:15:29.560
You're serious and diligent.

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:32.360
But you don't know much 
about the world, do you?

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:36.950
You have every appearance of 
a stiff and pointless man.

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:42.960
Hmph. Prideful men are all like this.

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.650
Jinguuji!

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:48.520
I-I know you're angry!

00:15:48.520 --> 00:15:51.220
So don't do anything stupid like arson!

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:57.100
<i>Th-This is...</i>

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:01.400
<i>When a supervisor asked for a 
party-trick-level performance,</i>

00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:04.450
<i>without compromising his honor, 
he made use of the fire alarm</i>

00:16:04.450 --> 00:16:07.800
<i>so that party tricks were declared 
forbidden! His special technique!</i>

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:09.110
<i>Fire-breathing!</i>

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:12.840
Was that entertaining, princess?

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:14.110
This guy...

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:18.120
You probably meant it as revenge 
for my treating you like a child,

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:19.970
but you picked the wrong opponent.

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:22.500
Unfortunately, there is nothing I cannot do.

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:26.000
Why do you want to travel 
with us in the first place?

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.000
That's...

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:30.250
That's enough, isn't it, Jinguuji?

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:33.370
She's hesitating because she's got a reason 
she doesn't want to tell us, right?

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:35.260
Pushing further would be childish.

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:37.010
Hero.

00:16:37.270 --> 00:16:38.260
Tachibana.

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:40.400
<i>I'm sorry, Jinguuji!</i>

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:42.790
<i>But the punch of a sound argument...</i>

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:45.400
<i>It doesn't work well on an adolescent!</i>

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:46.530
<i>So it might go back to...</i>

00:16:46.530 --> 00:16:47.900
Goodbye, world.

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:52.280
<i>And when I think it might turn out like that,
 I just can't take a strong stance!</i>

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:54.610
<i>We'll give up on convincing 
her through a frontal attack</i>

00:16:54.610 --> 00:16:55.660
<i>and go for weak points instead!</i>

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:59.140
Of course you can't! No!

00:17:00.530 --> 00:17:02.570
Suddenly saying you want to go on a journey...

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:04.800
What will you do about your official duties?

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:08.170
And most importantly, siding against
 the Demon Lord will be dangerous!

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:10.590
<i>When having trouble dealing 
with willful kids...</i>

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:12.920
<i>That's right! The best thing 
is to rely on their parent!</i>

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:15.710
Besides, you can't even 
get dressed by yourself.

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:18.300
And you can't sleep without 
your favorite towel.

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:21.310
<i>I didn't think it'd become 
a public execution.</i>

00:17:21.670 --> 00:17:23.410
<i>Impressive as usual, Tachibana.</i>

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:25.000
<i>By leaving it to her parent,</i>

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:28.310
<i>her heart will be smoothly, 
efficiently crushed.</i>

00:17:28.970 --> 00:17:31.870
<i>I was right in thinking that 
you're suited to human resources.</i>

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:35.510
<i>For thinking, even for a moment, that you 
wanted to bring a woman on our journey</i>

00:17:35.510 --> 00:17:36.570
<i>I wish you'd punch me.</i>

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:40.650
As things stand, what do 
you think, honored hero?

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:42.660
Of course, it is just as 
you say, Your Majesty.

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:45.830
At the very least, she should be able 
to go to the bathroom alone at night.

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.330
<b>Talk Talk Talk Talk</b>

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:48.670
And as royalty, her duties 
should take precedence.

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:48.670
<i>Idiot, cut it out!</i>

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:50.750
<i>What're you trying to 
increase the damage for?</i>

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:51.320
I'm sure there are things she must 
do for the sake of the people.

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:53.710
Don't panic, Tachibana. It's all right.

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:55.020
I understand everything.

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:58.130
"Break her until there's nothing left," right?

00:17:58.130 --> 00:18:00.510
<i>I'm sure he doesn't get it at all!</i>

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:03.100
Yggie, you understand, don't you?

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:06.470
Don't ask for things like a 
willful child might anymore.

00:18:07.490 --> 00:18:08.520
Father.

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:10.640
It's slipped.

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:14.780
And, Four-Eyes, are you having 
fun looking so smug?

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:17.650
Even though you don't 
understand a single thing?

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:19.370
Oh, this is just ludicrous!

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:22.200
Father and Four-Eyes, both! 
Everyone's stupid! Baldy!

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:24.460
I don't care about Demon Lords 
or heroes anymore!

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:25.690
This world can just get destroyed!

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:27.420
Sh-She knew?

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:29.040
Your Majesty, stay strong!

00:18:29.530 --> 00:18:30.680
Princess!

00:18:30.680 --> 00:18:31.880
Wait, Tachibana.

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:34.340
We may be inside the castle, but you 
shouldn't move around on your own.

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:36.520
Don't follow me!

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:38.970
You're way too bad at handling adolescents!

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:40.890
It's better if I do this alone!

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:44.970
Princess, are you there?

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:48.850
Whoa! What are you doing?!

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:48.850
<b>Bash Bash</b>

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:52.120
It's plain to see I'm venting my anger.

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:53.110
I can tell!

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:55.970
I have to do at least this much, or else...

00:18:55.970 --> 00:18:58.610
This is what it means to live here!

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:00.860
That's amazing!

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:03.240
It's commendable that you know 
how to blow off steam.

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:05.140
And because you're commendable, please...

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:06.650
Won't you calm down, just a little?

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:09.640
Hero, the truth is...

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:12.500
I don't even have the freedom to leave.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:15.880
My mother died when I was born...

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:19.130
and my father became overly protective.

00:19:19.480 --> 00:19:23.010
I don't have any friends who share 
my station or are close to my age...

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:26.640
No memories of running across 
grassy fields... Nothing.

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:30.160
I've never found anything I wanted to do.

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:32.220
It's all pointless.

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:35.650
<i>Oh, I've seen this before.</i>

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:38.900
<i>No wonder I can't leave her alone.</i>

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:40.470
Princess.

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:43.710
Is there anything I can do?

00:19:43.710 --> 00:19:44.760
I'll help!

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:48.910
If there's something you want to do, 
then I want to make it a reality.

00:19:49.340 --> 00:19:52.170
Hero! You'll help me?

00:19:52.410 --> 00:19:53.390
Of course!

00:19:55.680 --> 00:19:57.980
Rise, my people!

00:19:57.980 --> 00:20:02.760
A king who is caught up in outward beauty and 
forgets true worth is unfit to rule!

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:05.180
Um, wait... What is this?

00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:09.680
The leaders of the rebellion are 
Princess Ygraine and the hero.

00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:16.190
The rebel army is calling for a new ruler
 and the abolishment hereditary succession.

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:18.780
How did this happen?

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:21.950
Now that it's come to this, we have no choice. 
We'll deploy the military and—

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:25.420
If we do that and Yggie 
gets hurt, what then?

00:20:25.420 --> 00:20:27.120
We can't!

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:32.580
Then what if we use the intelligence 
department to contain the princess in secret?

00:20:32.950 --> 00:20:34.300
That's good.

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:36.570
Can you do it, intelligence department?

00:20:36.570 --> 00:20:39.320
Isn't this the time for a 
deadweight department to shine?

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:40.340
Can you do it?

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:42.040
W-We can!

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:44.340
Well said. I'm counting on you!

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:48.000
So our supervisor, unable to 
refuse such unreasonable demands,

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:50.720
has gone to make a suicide attack on 
the rebel army. That was the highlight.

00:20:51.070 --> 00:20:53.520
I see. Well, that's good.

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:55.980
Even in a melancholy mood, you're sublime.

00:20:56.370 --> 00:20:59.370
<i>Tachibana, what should I do?</i>

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:02.200
<i>Staying with a rebel army is too dangerous!</i>

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:04.970
<i>I want to drag you back here, 
even if it's against your will, but...</i>

00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:06.580
Yay!

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:09.160
Don't follow me!

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:13.720
<i>Could it be that Tachibana actually 
wanted to travel with that woman?</i>

00:21:14.240 --> 00:21:15.140
<i>It can't be.</i>

00:21:16.090 --> 00:21:18.000
<i>No... It's possible.</i>

00:21:18.580 --> 00:21:22.510
<i>She's got exactly the kind of looks 
Tachibana likes. Plus, she's a princess!</i>

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:25.170
<i>When we went to have the 
king give her a scolding,</i>

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:28.250
<i>was it actually to have the 
king give his permission?</i>

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:31.600
Even though you don't 
understand a single thing?

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:34.890
<i>I don't understand a single thing?</i>

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:36.420
<i>Tachibana!</i>

00:21:36.420 --> 00:21:39.100
<i>What is it that I should do?!</i>

00:21:45.060 --> 00:21:46.840
I shall give my report.

00:21:47.420 --> 00:21:50.340
Mouria has failed and been captured.

00:21:50.340 --> 00:21:51.950
So it was futile after all.

00:21:52.460 --> 00:21:54.800
Somehow, I had the feeling it would be.

00:21:54.800 --> 00:21:57.210
What a coincidence. So did I.

00:21:57.670 --> 00:21:58.910
There's no other choice.

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:03.050
Call in that person.

00:22:03.400 --> 00:22:04.560
That person?

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:08.720
<b>with</b>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:36.180
This is Mouria!

00:23:36.180 --> 00:23:39.240
Everyone, studying and working 
every day must be really hard.

00:23:39.240 --> 00:23:41.010
Please make sure not to 
push yourself too hard.

00:23:41.010 --> 00:23:44.520
I've tried a little too hard and gotten 
myself caught by the rebel army!

00:23:43.650 --> 00:23:49.990
<b>Episode 10 

00:23:44.520 --> 00:23:45.240
Sob, sob!

00:23:45.240 --> 00:23:47.320
Next time! "A Guy Who Reincarnated as 
a Fantasy Knockout and a Rebel Army!"

00:23:47.320 --> 00:23:49.990
Next time, we've got a guy who reincarnated 
as a fantasy knockout again, too!
